The Bliss Exchange is a part of the Bliss Rest Stop, a space for creativity, community, and connection. Open to all ages, abilities, and backgrounds, this special corner invites visitors to swap more than just books. Founded by Rowena Cage, an artist, author, and advocate, the Bliss Exchange offers a delightful mix of items to share and enjoy. Alongside books, you’ll discover a rotated Lego Exchange, Love Note Exchange, Mini Car Exchange, Bugs and Crawler Exchange and even a Free Period Products Exchange, thanks to a partnership with local nonprofit Access Period. Other fun items that rotate throughout the seasons, making each visit unique and full of surprises. Whether you’re grabbing something from the space or just enjoying the creative atmosphere, the Bliss Exchange is all about building community, one little act of sharing at a time.

